          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" hidden>
            <p>Absolutely! MakerCreate is a completely free program run by volunteers at HackClub. MakerCreate is a YSWS program funded by HackClub, a US-based 501(c)(3) nonprofit that helps teens get involved with technology.</p>
          </div>
